{"id":"vod_sn_37236","vodId":"37236","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"风之圣痕","name_cn":"风之圣痕","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d83925202b8181914544fdd5a87be9b2.jpg"},"summary":"神凪和麻（小野大辅 配音）出生于使用炎术的名门之家，然而却因为缺乏才能而被父亲神凪严马（小山力也 配音）赶出了家门。在一次偶然中，和麻意外遇见了强大的风之精灵王，并与其签订了契约，拥有了风之圣痕，并成为了最强的风术师。　　一晃眼，和麻离开日本已经四年了，当他回到这片称之为故乡的土地之时，他想要拥有的，不过只是平静的生活。某日，和麻遇见了名为神凪绫乃（藤村步 配音）的少女，她是神凪一族宗家的长女，亦是下一任宗主。尽管绫乃个性傲娇又迟钝，但和麻还是感受到了隐藏在她内心深处的善良，遂两人开始一起行动，而命运的齿轮亦就此开始转动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LFYWnJ8Uy91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1r4Bcgh6j41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h54JCpUztj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EAvRn7uDcM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mnM4k7rgDh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JBgTXx0BQ41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4mtHuV2GsN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VHz29zN8K01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ptApkVz1r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BcxwDw6qR31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xAsEjfFK2c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/83jS7r0F4B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pnskKfPz4N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uD3wBqu2ty1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6